```Query 4: Detect Data Exfiltration
Alerts on any internal host that transmits more than 50 MB to a single external destination within 10 minutes.```
index=network direction=outbound action=allow
| bin _time span=10m
| stats sum(bytes_out) AS total_bytes BY _time src_ip dest_ip dest_port
| where total_bytes > 50*1024*1024
| eval total_mb=round(total_bytes/1024/1024, 0)
| sort - total_mb
| table _time src_ip dest_ip dest_port total_mb
